{"id":"dms-sa8.12","title":"ResultView save state machine: unsaved/dirty/saving/saved with explicit Save button","description":"Track explicit save state on the working ScanResult. Pipeline auto-persist sets state to unsaved (original saved, no edits). Each user edit transitions unsaved|saved -\u003e dirty. Save button transitions dirty -\u003e saving -\u003e saved. TestCaseBundle export disabled in dirty state. editCount derived at save time = count(cells where userOverride != nil OR userAdded == true) + count(unplaced where action != .none). No event log.","notes":"Spec: result-rendering §Save state machine. Design.md: D4. Tasks.md: 9.6.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:22Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:22Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-sa8.12","depends_on_id":"dms-sa8","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T14:00:21Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-sa8.11","title":"Unplaced strip UI: thumbnails + place/edit/keep/discard actions","description":"Add an Unplaced strip UI alongside the grid in ResultView when unplaced list is non-empty. Each item shows a cropped thumbnail of the source image around the bbox, payload (or '(no payload)'), and reason. Tap opens an action sheet: place at (row, col), edit payload, keep as outlier (row=-1,col=-1), discard (preserved in CSV with status=discarded).","notes":"Spec: result-rendering §Unplaced strip UI. Design.md: D3. Tasks.md: 9.5.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:21Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:21Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-sa8.11","depends_on_id":"dms-sa8","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T14:00:21Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-1ni.11","title":"Derived-cell view-model: load rawPayloads -\u003e apply current regex -\u003e re-run inference -\u003e layer edits","description":"Implement the derived-cell view-model that transforms a StoredScan into the displayable [GridCell] + unplaced lists. Steps: (1) load rawPayloads, (2) apply current validatorRegex from @AppStorage, (3) re-run grid inference using stored layoutMode, (4) layer edits (userOverride, userAdded, discarded). Result must match original-scan-time view when regex and tunables are unchanged.","notes":"Spec: scan-storage §Cells are derived. Tasks.md: 8.5.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:20Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:20Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-1ni.11","depends_on_id":"dms-1ni","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T14:00:20Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-1ni.10","title":"StoredScan schema: derived-cell model (raw payloads + edits, validatorRegexAtCapture)","description":"StoredScan persists rawPayloads (payload+bbox+confidence+rawBytes), edits (userOverride per cell, userAdded, discarded flags), validatorRegexAtCapture (immutable), and layoutMode. NOT cells. Cell statuses are derived on view by re-applying current regex + re-running grid inference. Enables regex changes to propagate to history without migration.","notes":"Spec: scan-storage §Cells are derived. Design.md: D1. Tasks.md: 8.1. Supersedes scope of dms-1ni.5.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:06Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:06Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-1ni.10","depends_on_id":"dms-1ni","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T14:00:06Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-1ni.9","title":"CSVExporter: add discarded provenance status for explicitly-discarded unplaced detections","description":"Extend the provenance status enumeration in CSV export to include 'discarded'. Discarding an unplaced detection MUST keep a row (row=null,col=null,code=\u003cpayload\u003e,status=discarded) rather than dropping silently. Audit-grade requirement per charter §2.","notes":"Spec: csv-export §Optional provenance column. Design.md: D3. Tasks.md: 7.2.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:06Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:06Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-1ni.9","depends_on_id":"dms-1ni","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T14:00:05Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-d6u.7","title":"ImageAnnotator: split into live overlay (Canvas) and baked-image bake-out paths","description":"Refactor annotation into two distinct artifacts: (1) live overlay rendered via SwiftUI Canvas over the source UIImage, driven by current cells/unplaced lists, reflecting edits within one frame; (2) baked UIImage produced lazily on demand for share/save-to-Files/history-thumbnail/TestCaseBundle. PipelineEvent.annotated becomes the initial bake. Eliminates the staleness-after-edit window.","notes":"Spec: result-rendering §Live overlay; scan-pipeline §.annotated event. Design.md: D2. Tasks.md: 6.1, 6.4, 6.5.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:05Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:05Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-d6u.7","depends_on_id":"dms-d6u","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T14:00:04Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-5c3.10","title":"PayloadValidator: revalidate(scan, regex) pure function for historical re-validation","description":"Add a pure function to PayloadValidator that re-applies a regex over a StoredScan's raw payloads and returns updated GridCell statuses without mutating storage. Required for the derived-cell model: regex changes propagate to history automatically. validatorRegexAtCapture remains immutable.","notes":"Spec: payload-validation §Re-validation. Tasks.md: 3.4.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T17:59:49Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T17:59:49Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-5c3.10","depends_on_id":"dms-5c3","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T13:59:48Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-uff.8","title":"GridInferencer: produce unplaced list (spatial outliers, decode-failed bboxes, far-rejected codes)","description":"Extend GridInferencer to emit an unplaced: [UnplacedDetection] list alongside [GridCell]. Includes: spatial outliers in fixed mode (\u003eoutlierSigmaThreshold sigma from any ideal position), decode-failed bounding boxes (Vision saw a region but extracted no payload), and validator-rejected detections whose nearest ideal position is also beyond threshold. Never silently drop detections.","notes":"Spec: grid-inference §Unplaced detections. Tasks.md: 4.5.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T17:59:49Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T17:59:49Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-uff.8","depends_on_id":"dms-uff","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T13:59:49Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-5c3.9","title":"Define core type stubs (RawDetection, GridCell, CellStatus, UnplacedDetection, etc.)","description":"Define the v1 type stubs in a Models/ directory before any service implementation begins. Types: RawDetection, GridCell, CellStatus, UnreadableReason, BoxLayout, ScanResult, ScanError, PipelineEvent, PipelineStage, UnplacedDetection, StoredScan, StoredRawPayload, StoredEdit. These are referenced by every downstream service so they must land first.","notes":"Used DetectedCode (per architecture.md) instead of RawDetection from bd description; architecture.md is the canonical source per orchestrator instructions. Also added Recommendation/RecommendationAction (architecture.md references them under RemediationAdvisor). Added UnplacedReason and UnplacedAction enums supporting UnplacedDetection per design.md D3.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"Carolyn Aquino","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T17:59:42Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-03T19:33:48Z","started_at":"2026-05-03T19:24:19Z","closed_at":"2026-05-03T19:33:48Z","close_reason":"Models/ directory landed: 10 type files (DetectedCode, CellStatus/UnreadableReason, GridCell, BoxLayout, UnplacedDetection, ScanQualityReport, ScanResult/ScanError, PipelineEvent/PipelineStage, Recommendation, StoredScan/StoredRawPayload/StoredEdit). 12 ModelsTests passing, build green on iPhone 16 sim, swiftlint --strict clean. Committed in HEAD.","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-5c3.9","depends_on_id":"dms-5c3","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T13:59:41Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
