{"id":"dms-hub","title":"ZXingObjC fallback decoder integration (deferred from bootstrap)","description":"Bootstrap (dms-5c3.1) deferred ZXingObjC SPM integration because upstream zxingify-objc Package.swift declares unsafeFlags(['-fprofile-instr-generate']), which Swift Package Manager forbids when an iOS app target depends on the package directly. Options to evaluate: (1) vendor a local SPM wrapper package that re-exports a patched manifest without unsafe flags; (2) fork zxingify-objc and remove the unsafe flag; (3) use a different Data Matrix library; (4) drop ZXing fallback if Vision-only proves sufficient on the testbed corpus. Acceptance: BarcodeScanner can invoke a working ZXing path when Vision returns nil payloadStringValue, all callers compile, app target builds against iOS Simulator iPhone 16. See docs/vision-api-notes.md ZXingObjC Fallback section.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"chore","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-03T19:21:22Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-03T19:21:22Z","dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
{"id":"dms-2v4.13","title":"Docs sync: update charter/architecture/annotation/csv/grid/testbed docs to reflect v1 spec deltas","description":"After implementation, update the docs/ files to reflect the five design decisions captured in establish-v1-baseline: cells-as-derived (architecture.md), live overlay vs baked image (architecture.md, annotation-spec.md), discarded provenance status (csv-export-spec.md), validator-rejected outlier handling (grid-inference.md), editCount + outlier-resolution metadata (testbed-workflow.md). Five sub-tasks.","notes":"Spec source: design.md Goals/Non-Goals (these doc edits land during implementation, not in the proposal). Tasks.md: 11.1-11.5.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"epic","owner":"caquino1223@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:43Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","updated_at":"2026-05-01T18:00:43Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dms-2v4.13","depends_on_id":"dms-2v4","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-01T14:00:42Z","created_by":"Carolyn Aquino","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
